#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:5
#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:15
#: 8cf3d6bd98aa40888aab490493a9df2d ab924cc079a8435fae37f99e01cd30f6
msgid "Avionics Anonymous DroneCAN LIDAR Interface"
msgstr "Avionics Anonymous DroneCAN 激光雷达接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:7
#: ea50231b7cc74b92a8de41db72418b3e
msgid ""
"The `Avionics Anonymous DroneCAN LIDAR Interface "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface>`__ is a tiny "
"interface for `several common laser rangefinders "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface#currently-"
"supported-lasers>`__ that allows connection to Pixhawk and other similar "
"autopilots via DroneCAN - A nice robust interface, which provides high "
"reliability connections to peripherals over greater distances than I2C."
msgstr ""
"`Avionics Anonymous DroneCAN LIDAR 接口 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface>`__ 是一款微型接口，支持 "
"`多种常见激光测距仪 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface#currently-"
"supported-lasers>`__，可通过 DroneCAN 连接到 Pixhawk 及类似飞控——这是一种可靠的接口，比 I2C "
"提供更高可靠性和更远连接距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:17
#: 6c8cfe1dfd904e9eb9ec6754037d646e
msgid ""
"The following parameters should be set on the autopilot (and then reboot the"
" autopilot):"
msgstr "应在飞控上设置以下参数（然后重启飞控）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:19
#: 8821275fce6a4e83b35944c7c20cb2f9
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the 1st CAN port)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（启用第一路 CAN 端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:20
#: b23b2f0676bf48b9933d170b597bfb71
msgid "``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` = 24"
msgstr "``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` = 24"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:21
#: 55317ba914174d518b54ca89e3bddb31
msgid "``RNGFNDx_MIN`` based on your connected laser's datasheet"
msgstr "``RNGFNDx_MIN`` 根据所连接激光器的数据手册设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:22
#: 10f0827de3f2401ba38054b04f1b9a19
msgid "``RNGFNDx_MAX`` based on your connected laser's datasheet"
msgstr "``RNGFNDx_MAX`` 根据所连接激光器的数据手册设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:25
#: 3cfc7587a26445dfa0a52329e013ae39
msgid ""
"If the device does not work please follow the instructions on enabling the "
"CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` page, followed by "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps and then set the ``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` "
"parameter to 24."
msgstr ""
"如果设备无法工作，请按照 :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` 页面上的 CANBUS 启用说明操作，然后执行 "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` 步骤，并将 ``RNGFNDx_TYPE`` 参数设置为 24。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:27
#: 06ca9a1515b449b0859d71f084428214
msgid ""
"If the rangefinder attached is NOT a ``Lightware SF11/c``, then the DroneCAN"
" internal ``rangefinder_hw`` parameter of this unit must be set to the "
"appropriate rangefinder type using the SLCAN instructions above."
msgstr ""
"若连接的测距仪 **不是** ``Lightware SF11/c``，则必须按照上述 SLCAN 说明，将本模块的 DroneCAN 内部 "
"``rangefinder_hw`` 参数设置为对应的测距仪类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-laserint.rst:29
#: a4335b88fd974e9d9d46e02875c61fc2
msgid ""
"The `manufacturer's product page is here "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface>`__ for general "
"information about the device."
msgstr ""
"有关设备的一般信息，请访问 `制造商产品页面 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/laser_interface>`__。"
